<title>TAIWAN: NCD issues T$3 billion in 20-day CDs at 5.628 yld.</title>
<headline>NCD issues T$3 billion in 20-day CDs at 5.628 yld.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank on Tuesday issued T$3 billion in 20-day negotiable certificates of deposit at an average yield of 5.628 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of the yields was between 5.599 and 5.650 percent. Demand totalled T$6 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
